- DISPATCH: `solver_runs`, `dispatch_options`, `plan_variants`,
  `dispatch_offers`, `unit_holds`, `technician_offers`, `decision_records`.
- INVENTORY: `part_categories`, `parts`, `depots`, `unit_stock`,
