- `location.ts` — `locationSchema`, `carriagewayFromHeading()` (4 buckets),
  `locationColumns()`.
- `geo.ts` — `distanceKm()` (haversine), `nearestZone()`.

Intake service — `src/intake/`:
- `errors.ts` — `IntakeError` + `IntakeErrorCode` union + `statusForIntakeError`.
- `transaction.ts` — `runIntakeTransaction()`, retry-on-P2002 around the whole
